window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Before the age of magic—before the storms of the Xi Moon...</p> <p>The moon wasn't always electric...</p> <p>I wasn't always this brave...</p> <p>This is the story of <i>Gwyn's Kingdom</i>: a young girl living in the rural lands of Pantheon slips into a spellbinding tale of magic, mystery, and a dark power that threatens to devour kingdoms. Jack and Chele join her on this journey through a world rich in magic, lore, mystical places and beings.</p> <p>From Pantheon, to The Shadow Guild, to the Northern Queen's magnificent stronghold of Sterlington, prepare to cross paths with noble wizards, goblins, wood sprites, and creatures with skin covered in swirling smoke as Gwyn answers the call of destiny just beyond the veil.</p>"; 
